{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDI0L0JvZ2FydCUyMExpZmUlMjBDb21lcyUyMEluJTIwRmxhc2hlcyUyMCUyODIwMjQlMjkv","type":"movie","name":"Bogart Life Comes In Flashes","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/A5abUBQ3RB72p5mqp126FhzGHDE.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jv69RfccNXYefrqhdlbrMex3hRC.jpg","description":"The film focuses on the icon of Hollywood’s golden age, Humphrey Bogart, and is framed around his relationships with the five formidable women in his life – his mother and his four wives, including Lauren Bacall. Featuring unprecedented access to rare footage from the estate, and narrated exclusively in his own words, ‘Bogart: Life Comes in Flashes’ explores his journey to become the of star of timeless classics ‘Casablanca,’ ‘Maltese Falcon’’ and ‘The Big Sleep.’ Each relationship offers a deep and intimate understanding of a man for whom stardom was hard won and much deserved.\n\nRated 12 · Released 15 Nov 2024 · United Kingdom, United States of America · Language: English · 99 min\nStudio: Universal Pictures Content Group, Dog Star Films, Tara Films\n\nOn your server — Audio: English","releaseInfo":"2024","genres":["Documentary","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"6.9","imdb_id":"tt32736393","moviedb_id":1297453,"tmdbId":1297453,"runtime":"99 min","cast":["Humphrey Bogart","Enzo Squillino Jr.","Leon Finnan","Lauren Bacall","Ingrid Bergman","Kerry Shale","Stephen H. Bogart"],"director":["Kathryn Ferguson"],"writer":["Kathryn Ferguson","Eleanor Emptage"],"released":"2024-11-15T00:00:00.000Z","country":"United Kingdom, United States of America","language":"English","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Kathryn Ferguson","character":"Director","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/tD5NMBvRWEdlR73tbsB4CSmtf3x.jpg"},{"name":"Humphrey Bogart","character":"Self (archive footage)","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/4pk2VbOb2td7iBZyir6Ji46HH4N.jpg"},{"name":"Enzo Squillino Jr.","character":"Humphrey Bogart","